    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 Crokian Chief who rules Alligator Island. As a native Crokian who has lived in Innadril before humans and elves came, he hates outsiders and tries to protect his territory and tribe from them. Although he is not happy about the Water Couatl Ateka living on the same island, he cannot do anything about it because he is afraid of Water Dragon Fafurion. He dreams about the day when Crokians can rule Innadril again. Beast Lv. 3 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Beasts. Critical Damage +7.5% Atk. Spd. +5% Speed +5 Resistance to Derangement +20% Resistance to Sword +10% Resistance to Dual Sword +10% Resistance to Bleed -10% Resistance to Dagger -10% Resistance to Dual Dagger -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
